# Performance budget

- Prefer zero or minimal client JS; calculator logic is the main island.
- Initial JS ≤ 50 KB gzipped per page; no heavy frameworks without lazy/on-interaction load.
- System font stack (already in global.css); font-display swap if self-hosting later.
- Reserve ad slot min-heights; never shift the tool on load.
- Images: width/height, modern formats when added; preload only true LCP assets.
- CI must fail on budget regressions (`npm run audit:perf`, Lighthouse CI).
